---

<Layout
  title="Standing Desk Height for Tall People: The Exact Settings"
  description={`Exact standing desk height formula for users 6'0"–6'7". Elbow-height method, recommended desk ranges, and why most desks max out too low for tall people.`}
  canonical="https://tallchairadvisor.com/standing-desk-height-tall-people/"
